From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Mar 2026 23:53:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix migration chain, add NextAuth refresh, .env.dev, Railway
 deployment

- Merge 003b_missing_tables into 003_templates_and_outreach for clean
  linear Alembic migration chain; remove nuclear wipe hack from start.sh
- Add JWT access token auto-refresh in NextAuth jwt callback using
  backend /api/v1/auth/refresh endpoint (28-min rotation)
- Add SessionProvider to root providers for client-side getSession()
- Create .env.dev with working defaults for docker-compose up
- Add railway.toml deployment config; update Celery to auto-detect
  Redis as broker when RABBITMQ_URL points at redis:// (Railway compat)
- Update railway-deploy.md to reflect auto-conversion fixes

